{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RELIVE THE ORIGINAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.poster.avif?t=1756116128\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.webm?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.mp4?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Duck Life 4 Classic is a faithful remaster of the award-winning Flash hit played over 250 million times. For the first time since Flash support ended, the authentic original is back on PC - no browser, no plugins. The classic you remember from computer class, now running smoothly with modern quality-of-life upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR TEAM &amp; CUSTOMISE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.poster.avif?t=1756116128\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.webm?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.mp4?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch and train multiple ducks, assemble your best trio for tournaments, and personalise your flock with names and cosmetic options to make every champion feel like yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAINING MINI-GAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.poster.avif?t=1756116128\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.webm?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.mp4?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your skills across Running, Swimming, Flying, Climbing and for the first time in the series, Jumping. Play fast, replayable mini-games to earn coins and level up stats, building the perfect racer one session at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACES &amp; TOURNAMENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across 6 regions and train up your ducks to outpace rivals. Conquer multi-race tournaments\u2014including classic 3-duck team events\u2014on your way to championship glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPDATES &amp; MODERN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple save slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebalanced XP for a smoother progression curve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skippable tutorial for returning players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause anytime, custom key bindings, precise audio sliders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud, and Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here for nostalgia or discovering it fresh, Duck Life 4 Classic is the definitive way to play the original\u2014authentic Flash-era feel, modern conveniences, and zero hassle. Raise your duck, crush the mini-games, dominate the tournaments, and build a squad that wins it all.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874050?t=1756116128","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/bf89893cc2762288d955e677cd71521f54bf53cf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756116128","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/43de652015c08f361c6ee90cccd7fa9641f15441/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756116128","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/43de652015c08f361c6ee90cccd7fa9641f15441/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756116128","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RELIVE THE ORIGINAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.poster.avif?t=1756116128\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.webm?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.mp4?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Duck Life 4 Classic is a faithful remaster of the award-winning Flash hit played over 250 million times. For the first time since Flash support ended, the authentic original is back on PC - no browser, no plugins. The classic you remember from computer class, now running smoothly with modern quality-of-life upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR TEAM &amp; CUSTOMISE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.poster.avif?t=1756116128\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.webm?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.mp4?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch and train multiple ducks, assemble your best trio for tournaments, and personalise your flock with names and cosmetic options to make every champion feel like yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAINING MINI-GAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.poster.avif?t=1756116128\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.webm?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.mp4?t=1756116128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your skills across Running, Swimming, Flying, Climbing and for the first time in the series, Jumping. Play fast, replayable mini-games to earn coins and level up stats, building the perfect racer one session at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACES &amp; TOURNAMENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across 6 regions and train up your ducks to outpace rivals. Conquer multi-race tournaments\u2014including classic 3-duck team events\u2014on your way to championship glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPDATES &amp; MODERN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple save slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebalanced XP for a smoother progression curve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skippable tutorial for returning players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause anytime, custom key bindings, precise audio sliders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud, and Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re here for nostalgia or discovering it fresh, Duck Life 4 Classic is the definitive way to play the original\u2014authentic Flash-era feel, modern conveniences, and zero hassle. Raise your duck, crush the mini-games, dominate the tournaments, and build a squad that wins it all.</p>","developers":["Wix Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/79e247bf625324edc0a22a8d15cf1d220ac8a2e1/header.jpg?t=1756116128","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel x64 (SSE2) or Apple Silicon