 and style a custom duck team. No browser needed, just pure nostalgia on PC","steam_appid":3874050,"support_info":{"email":"help@wixgames.co.uk","url":"https://games.wixgames.co.uk/contact.php"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}